```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner credential revoke --help
Revoke a runner credential immediately

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner credential revoke [OPTIONS] <ORGANIZATION> <RUNNER> <CREDENTIAL>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUNNER>        Runner ID or exact name
  <CREDENTIAL>    Runner credential ID

Options:
      --json                 Print the runner result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http  Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                 Print help

```
